---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Dandar"
	description="Meet Dandar: ISE student at the University of Limerick and creator of Mizo AI."
	pubDate={new Date('October 04 2026')}
>
	<div class="profile-intro">
		<div class="eyebrow">
			<img
				class="profile-avatar"
				src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103852756?v=4"
				alt="Dandar's GitHub profile picture"
				width="57"
				height="57"
			/>
			<span>A BIT ABOUT ME</span>
		</div>
		<p>
			Hey, I’m Dandar, an ISE student at the University of Limerick and the creator of{' '}
			<a href="https://github.com/DandarGaming/Mizo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mizo AI</a>.
			I like turning ideas into projects, learning by building, and sharing the useful parts of the process.
		</p>
		<p>
			This blog is my notebook along the way: a place for project updates, technical experiments,
			coursework discoveries, and things I’d like to remember.
		</p>
	</div>

	<h2>Things I’m building</h2>
	<ul class="project-list">
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/DandarGaming/Mizo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mizo AI</a>
			<span>My AI project. Check GitHub for the code and current details.</span>
		</li>
		<li>
			<a href="https://github.com/DandarGaming/portfolio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Portfolio</a>
			<span>A home for my projects and work.</span>
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Tools I’ve been exploring</h2>
	<p class="skill-list" aria-label="Programming languages and technologies">
		<span>Java</span>
		<span>JavaScript</span>
		<span>Python</span>
		<span>TensorFlow</span>
		<span>CSS</span>
	</p>

	<p class="profile-cta">
		You can find my projects and what I’m working on at{' '}
		<a href="https://github.com/DandarGaming" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">my GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>

<style>
	.eyebrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 13px;
		margin: 0 0 15px;
		color: var(--signal-red);
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	.profile-avatar {
		width: 57px;
		height: 57px;
		padding: 3px;
		border: 1px solid #334052;
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: linear-gradient(145deg, #48b8ff 0 48%, #ff496c 52% 100%);
		object-fit: cover;
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #0b0d14;
	}

	.profile-intro p:not(.eyebrow) {
		color: #c0c8d6;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-top: 2.3em;
		font-size: 1.65rem;
	}

	.project-list {
		display: grid;
		gap: 12px;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.project-list li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(110px, 0.32fr) 1fr;
		gap: 16px;
		padding: 15px 16px;
		border: 1px solid #252a37;
		background: #090b11;
	}

	.project-list a {
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.project-list span {
		color: #aab3c5;
	}

	.skill-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 9px;
	}

	.skill-list span {
		padding: 5px 10px;
		border: 1px solid #293044;
		background: #10131b;
		color: #86ceff;
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
	}

	.profile-cta {
		margin-top: 3em;
		padding: 18px;
		border-left: 2px solid var(--signal-red);
		background: #0b0d14;
		color: #aab3c5;
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.project-list li {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 4px;
		}
	}
</style>
